<div class="mk-crumbbar"><div class="mk-wrap in"><a href="/markets">Markets</a><span class="sep">&rsaquo;</span><a href="/markets/consumer">Consumer Electronics</a><span class="sep">&rsaquo;</span><span class="here">Wireless Charging</span></div></div><div class="mk-spoke-grid"><aside class="mk-side"><div class="side-head"><span class="side-head-label">Consumer Electronics products</span><button type="button" class="mk-side-toggle" aria-label="Collapse sidebar"><span class="chev"><i data-lucide="chevron-right" style="width:13px;height:13px;"></i></span></button></div><a class="s" href="/markets/consumer/smt-sensors"><span class="abbr">SS</span><span class="label">SMT &amp; Sensor Assembly</span></a><a class="s active" href="/markets/consumer/wireless-charging"><span class="abbr">WC</span><span class="label">Wireless Charging</span></a><div class="helper"><div class="h">Not sure which fits?</div><p>Tell us what the device does and the volumes you expect and we&rsquo;ll point you to the right line.</p><a class="cta" href="/contact">Work with us <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></a></div></aside><div class="mk-spoke-main"><section class="mk-hero" data-hana-bg="flow" data-variant="light" data-fade="none"><div class="mk-wrap mk-hero-in"><div><div class="mk-eyebrow">Consumer Electronics &middot; Wireless Charging</div><h1 class="mk-h1">Wireless charging module assembly</h1><p class="mk-lede">Hana manufactures wireless charging products from coil assembly and PCBA through to box build and functional test. Coil winding and assembly are available within the Hana group, allowing the magnetic assembly and charging electronics to be managed within the same manufacturing program.</p><div class="mk-btns"><a href="/contact" class="hana-btn hana-btn-primary" style="padding:12px 22px;font-size:12px;">Talk to us <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:14px;height:14px;margin-left:6px;"></i></a><a href="#specialize-wireless-charging" class="hana-btn hana-btn-secondary" style="padding:12px 22px;font-size:12px;">What we specialize in</a></div></div><div class="mk-hero-media"><div class="mk-ph" style="aspect-ratio:auto;height:420px;border-bottom:0;"><div style="position:absolute;top:10px;left:12px;width:18px;height:18px;opacity:.4;z-index:1;"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--hana-blue)" stroke-width="1.5"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"></circle><path d="M12 3v4M12 17v4M3 12h4M17 12h4"></path></svg></div><span class="cap">[ Wireless Charging &mdash; photography needed ]</span></div></div></div></section><section id="specialize-wireless-charging" data-hana-bg="hex" data-variant="light" data-fade="none" style="background:var(--bg);border-top:1px solid var(--line);position:relative;overflow:hidden;"><div class="mk-wrap" style="position:relative;z-index:1;padding-top:64px;padding-bottom:60px;"><div style="max-width:700px;margin-bottom:26px;"><h2 class="mk-h2">What we specialize in</h2><p class="mk-body">At production volume, charging performance depends on repeatable coil manufacture, the coil-to-PCBA interconnect and consistent final assembly. Keeping these processes within the Hana manufacturing group can simplify control of the interfaces between them.</p></div><div class="mk-sheet"><div class="row"><div class="lab"><span class="n">01</span><span class="t">Wound coils and coil assemblies</span></div><div class="desc">Coil winding and coil assembly available within the Hana group as part of the overall charging-module manufacturing process.</div></div><div class="row"><div class="lab"><span class="n">02</span><span class="t">Charging electronics</span></div><div class="desc">Driver and control PCBAs manufactured on Hana's high-volume SMT lines, with production to Qi/WPC requirements where specified by the program.</div></div><div class="row"><div class="lab"><span class="n">03</span><span class="t">Complete charging units</span></div><div class="desc">Assembly of chargers, charging pads and charging modules through to finished units, including enclosure, wiring and mechanical components.</div></div><div class="row"><div class="lab"><span class="n">04</span><span class="t">Functional test</span></div><div class="desc">Functional verification of the assembled charging unit to the test requirements defined by the program.</div></div></div><div class="mk-caplinks"><p class="note">Further process detail on the high-volume surface-mount, inspection and test processes supporting this work is available on the PCBA &amp; Box Build capability page.</p><div class="links"><a href="/capabilities/pcba-box-build">Explore PCBA &amp; Box Build <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></a></div></div></div></section><section style="background:var(--hana-blue-tint);border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);"><div class="mk-wrap" style="padding-top:56px;padding-bottom:56px;"><div style="max-width:700px;margin-bottom:24px;"><div class="mk-eyebrow">Footprint</div><h2 class="mk-h2 sm">Where we build</h2></div><div class="mk-locs"><a class="mk-loc" href="/locations/koh-kong"><span class="co"><i data-lucide="map-pin" style="width:13px;height:13px;color:var(--hana-blue);"></i><span class="hana-spec-label">Cambodia</span></span><div class="nm">Koh Kong</div><div class="note">charger assembly and box build, high volume</div><span class="cta">View plant <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></a><a class="mk-loc" href="/locations/jiaxing"><span class="co"><i data-lucide="map-pin" style="width:13px;height:13px;color:var(--hana-blue);"></i><span class="hana-spec-label">China</span></span><div class="nm">Jiaxing</div><div class="note">coil assembly, charging electronics PCBA</div><span class="cta">View plant <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></a></div><p style="margin:18px 0 0;"><a href="/locations" class="hana-link" style="font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.1em;">All locations <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:13px;height:13px;"></i></a></p></div></section><section style="background:#fff;border-top:1px solid var(--line);"><div class="mk-wrap" style="padding-top:56px;padding-bottom:60px;"><div style="max-width:700px;margin-bottom:22px;"><div class="mk-eyebrow">FAQ</div><h2 class="mk-h2 sm">Frequently asked questions</h2></div><div style="max-width:860px;"><details class="mk-faq" open><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">What does a wireless charging module consist of?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">As Hana builds it: a wound coil, the driver and control PCBA behind it, and the mechanical assembly that holds the two together — supplied as a module or as a finished, enclosed unit.</p></details><details class="mk-faq"><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">What devices can Hana build charging modules for?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Consumer chargers and charging pads, home devices and appliances, and wearable products, including charging cases assembled alongside the device they charge. For medical and wearable-medical charging specifically, see <a href="/markets/medical">Medical</a>.</p></details><details class="mk-faq"><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">Does Hana build to the Qi standard?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Yes. Hana can manufacture wireless charging products to requirements based on the Qi standard published by the Wireless Power Consortium. Hana is not the certification holder for the finished consumer product; certification remains with the product owner. The applicable standard and conformance requirements are agreed for each program.</p></details><details class="mk-faq"><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">How can Hana test charging function in production?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Functional test is carried out on the assembled unit to the test requirements defined by the program. The test scope and any standards-related requirements are agreed for each build.</p></details></div><div style="margin-top:40px;padding-top:26px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);"><a href="/markets/consumer" class="hana-link" style="font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.1em;"><i data-lucide="arrow-left" style="width:13px;height:13px;"></i> Back to the Consumer Electronics market hub</a></div></div></section><section class="mk-cta" data-hana-bg="flow" data-variant="dark" data-fade="none"><div class="mk-wrap in"><div><h2 class="mk-h2 on-dark" style="max-width:520px;">Talk to us about your wireless charging program</h2><p class="mk-body on-dark" style="font-size:16px;max-width:480px;">Tell us what you need built and we will come back with a plan.</p></div><div class="acts"><a href="/contact" class="hana-btn hana-btn-on-dark" style="padding:12px 22px;font-size:12px;">Contact us <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:14px;height:14px;margin-left:6px;"></i></a></div></div></section></div></div>